FreeRTOS BSP Driver (DRV)
###############################

Origin:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation
   https://github.com/renesas-rcar/FreeRTOS

Status:
   version v2.2.0

Purpose:
   FreeRTOS BSP driver for R-Car Gen 5.

Description:
   This package is a snapshot from the R-Car FreeRTOS BSP driver released by Renesas Electronics Corporation
   It contain the HAL for Renesas R-Car Gen 5 SoC

Dependencies:
    None.

